Kaula i: ['html'] hana: { <- (
		iho
		pani: ['&'] me: ['&amp;'],
		pani: ['<'] me: ['&lt;'],
		pani: ['>'] me: ['&gt;'],
		pani: ['"'] me: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Papa hou.

['Verbatim Syntax'] nā-hua pākahi: { :helu :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (helu), Letter: letter).
}.

Huapuka list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list hoʻohui: ['↵']).

Huapuka kākau: template.

